---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Opportunities - Effective Altruism Durham"
	description="Explore exciting career advice, mentoring, online courses, and recommendations within the Effective Altruism community."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main
		class="relative min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center bg-fixed bg-no-repeat"
		style="background-image: url('/assets/shared/page-hero-bg.jpg');"
	>
		<!-- Semi-transparent cream overlay to align with the EA brand theme and ensure readability -->
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#f4efe9]/85 backdrop-blur-[2px]"></div>

		<!-- Content container -->
		<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px] px-5 py-16 md:py-24">
			<!-- Page Title -->
			<div class="text-center mb-12">
				<h1
					class="font-ea-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal tracking-[0.25em] text-[#054d5a] uppercase mb-4"
				>
					Opportunities
				</h1>
				<div class="mx-auto h-[3px] w-24 bg-[#0c869b] mb-6"></div>
				<p
					class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] max-w-[800px] mx-auto"
				>
					There are so many exciting opportunities within the Effective Altruism
					community as a whole, and within Effective Altruism Durham (of
					course!), so here are some of our favourites!
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 1: Arthur Field Publicity Officer (Contact Card) -->
			<div
				class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 mb-16 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30"
			>
				<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
					<div class="flex-shrink-0">
						<a
							href="https://calendly.com/alexvellins/hello"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="block transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"
						>
							<img
								src="/assets/opportunities/IMG_1647_edited.jpg"
								alt="Arthur Field"
								class="w-[200px] h-[200px] md:w-[220px] md:h-[220px] rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-[#e8dfd3]"
							/>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1 text-center md:text-left">
						<p
							class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-8 font-semibold"
						>
							There's a lot of stuff here, so if you're still not sure I,
							(Arthur Field, Publicity Officer of EA Durham), would love to
							chat! There is no application form and no preparation needed. I
							can talk you through what events EA Durham are running that might
							help as well as signposting you to useful places
						</p>
						<div
							class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4"
						>
							<a
								href="https://calendly.com/arthur-field04"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer noopener"
								class="group inline-flex h-[50px] px-8 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
								style="background-color: #68246d;"
								onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
								onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
							>
								<span>Let's chat!</span>
							</a>
							<a
								href="mailto:kwjc75@durham.ac.uk"
								class="group inline-flex h-[50px] px-8 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-[#68246d] border-2 border-[#68246d] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#68246d]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]"
							>
								<span>Or email me!</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2: Advising and Mentoring -->
			<div class="mb-16">
				<h2
					class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] tracking-wide mb-8 uppercase text-center md:text-left"
				>
					Advising and Mentoring
				</h2>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
					<!-- 80,000 Hours Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
							<a
								href="/free-careers-advice"
								class="block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
							>
								<img
									src="/assets/opportunities/80000hours.png"
									alt="80,000 Hours Logo"
									class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg"
								/>
							</a>
						</div>

						<div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
							<div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] font-bold"
								>
									80,000 hours do a bunch of research into the world's most
									pressing problems, and how to find the best career to tackle
									them, so they offer free online 1-1 career advice focused on
									helping you to improve the world as much as possible.
								</p>
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040]"
								>
									Josh and Amber have learnt lots about 80k and their advice for
									having a high-impact career and they can help with any
									questions you have!
								</p>
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040]"
								>
									We've written more about what EA Durham people have to say
									here:
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3">
								<a
									href="/free-careers-advice"
									class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[45px] px-5 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
									style="background-color: #68246d;"
									onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
									onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
								>
									WHAT OUR MEMBERS SAY
								</a>
								<a
									href="https://80000hours.org/speak-with-us/"
									target="_blank"
									rel="noreferrer noopener"
									class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[45px] px-5 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[14px] font-bold text-[#68246d] border-2 border-[#68246d] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#68246d]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]"
								>
									APPLY NOW!
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Magnify Mentoring Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
							<a
								href="https://www.magnifymentoring.org/"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer noopener"
								class="block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
							>
								<img
									src="/assets/opportunities/Magnify.png"
									alt="Magnify Mentoring Logo"
									class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg"
								/>
							</a>
						</div>

						<div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
							<div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] font-bold"
								>
									Magnify Mentoring has a wholesome and inclusive community of
									500 people across 50 countries.
								</p>
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040]"
								>
									While they typically focus on women, non-binary and
									transgender people, they have recently opened an unrestricted
									round for people of all minorities.
								</p>
								<p
									class="font-ea-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040]"
								>
									Through Magnify Mentoring, I was paired with a mentor who is
									very kind, knowledgeable and experience in a variety of
									fields. I would personally strongly recommend them!
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3">
								<a
									href="https://www.magnifymentoring.org/"
									target="_blank"
									rel="noreferrer noopener"
									class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[45px] px-5 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[14px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
									style="background-color: #68246d;"
									onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
									onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
								>
									LEARN MORE
								</a>
								<a
									href="https://forms.zohopublic.com/eamentorshipprogram/form/MagnifyMenteePilotRoundApplicationForm/formperma/rRMrKjLA1-L0T3N_IhdqEuCNR-1ks_z5ot9SkD1EgpQ"
									target="_blank"
									rel="noreferrer noopener"
									class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center inline-flex h-[45px] px-5 items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[14px] font-bold text-[#68246d] border-2 border-[#68246d] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#68246d]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]"
								>
									APPLY NOW!
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3: Online Courses -->
			<div class="mb-16">
				<h2
					class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] tracking-wide mb-4 uppercase text-center md:text-left"
				>
					Online Courses
				</h2>
				<p
					class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-8 text-center md:text-left"
				>
					These 12 week online courses, by BlueDot Impact, are open now. They
					involve learning alongside others with an experienced facilitator; and
					help you in your next steps by sharing opportunities within their
					large network and potentially connecting you with recruiters.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
					<!-- AGI Strategy Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 overflow-hidden rounded-lg w-full max-w-[280px]">
							<a
								href="https://bluedot.org/courses/agi-strategy"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer noopener"
								class="block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
							>
								<img
									src="/assets/opportunities/AISF.png"
									alt="AISF - AGI Strategy Course"
									class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg"
								/>
							</a>
						</div>

						<a
							href="https://bluedot.org/courses/agi-strategy"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="w-full text-center inline-flex h-[50px] items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[15px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
							style="background-color: #68246d;"
							onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
							onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
						>
							AGI STRATEGY
						</a>
					</div>

					<!-- Pandemics Course Card -->
					<div
						class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex flex-col justify-between items-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
					>
						<div class="mb-6 overflow-hidden rounded-lg w-full max-w-[280px]">
							<a
								href="https://bluedot.org/courses/biosecurity"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer noopener"
								class="block transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
							>
								<img
									src="/assets/opportunities/Pandemics.jpg"
									alt="Pandemics & Biosecurity Course"
									class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-lg"
								/>
							</a>
						</div>

						<a
							href="https://bluedot.org/courses/biosecurity"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer noopener"
							class="w-full text-center inline-flex h-[50px] items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[15px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
							style="background-color: #68246d;"
							onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
							onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
						>
							PANDEMICS & BIOSECURITY COURSE
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4: Our Recommendations -->
			<div
				class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30"
			>
				<h2
					class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] tracking-wide mb-6 uppercase"
				>
					Our Recommendations
				</h2>

				<p
					class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-6"
				>
					If that wasn't enough, I've compiled some recommendations that I'm
					excited about in a google document. It contains:
				</p>

				<ul
					class="font-ea-body text-base leading-relaxed text-[#404040] space-y-3 mb-8 max-w-[700px] mx-auto text-left list-disc list-inside"
				>
					<li>Regularly updated time sensitive opportunities,</li>
					<li>
						Motivating and mental health resources that I think more Effective
						Altruists should read, and
					</li>
					<li>
						Cause area specific resources, including job boards and newsletters.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<div class="mb-10">
					<a
						href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1RtKyNa6_tvynjjYVfT_Lk5uI7LzZyJgGaWmZefrA1BE/edit?tab=t.0"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noreferrer noopener"
						class="inline-flex h-[54px] w-[268px] items-center justify-center rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
						style="background-color: #68246d;"
						onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
						onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
					>
						VIEW OPPORTUNITIES
					</a>
				</div>

				<p class="font-ea-heading text-xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] italic">
					Phew, that's it! I hope this helped :D
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Layout>
